    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022\u00a0<strong>Maroxyn Drarea\u00a0\u2022</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person horror game set in a lightless, desolate realm. With no weapons, no companions, and no help, your only tools are three spells - each used at a cost. In a hostile environment that aims to keep you forever, with fog and darkness covering every direction, your escape lies within light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 <strong>The Sigils\u00a0</strong>\u2022</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Six sigils of light exist somewhere in the gloom; scattered and hidden - find and activate them all and you may escape.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/c3509ea429a9210237badc72e74c6c4a.poster.avif?t=1755711010\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/c3509ea429a9210237badc72e74c6c4a.webm?t=1755711010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/c3509ea429a9210237badc72e74c6c4a.mp4?t=1755711010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2022 Limited but crucial spells. One casts light. One reveals truth. One guards you for a moment longer \u2022</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2022 Lucent \u2022</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\u00a0<strong>Use Lucent to cast a light that helps you navigate and see farther than the darkness allows.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/e2def72e2fab448c0de4084e32768af3.poster.avif?t=1755711010\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/e2def72e2fab448c0de4084e32768af3.webm?t=1755711010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/e2def72e2fab448c0de4084e32768af3.mp4?t=1755711010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 <strong>Descry\u00a0</strong>\u2022</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\u00a0<strong>Use Descry to reveal the truth, find the sigils, and navigate your way to them. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/76c6f4c1ba1d09edbbf3f5d4005fa9e3.poster.avif?t=1755711010\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/76c6f4c1ba1d09edbbf3f5d4005fa9e3.webm?t=1755711010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/76c6f4c1ba1d09edbbf3f5d4005fa9e3.mp4?t=1755711010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/9cac023ed4f2a4d2a4e87b7dccd8dc4d.poster.avif?t=1755711010\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/9cac023ed4f2a4d2a4e87b7dccd8dc4d.webm?t=1755711010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/9cac023ed4f2a4d2a4e87b7dccd8dc4d.mp4?t=1755711010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 <strong>Ward\u00a0</strong>\u2022</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Use Ward to cast a shield that gives you an extra chance at survival.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/013f4911b82b2bcea83875a83c9f7619.poster.avif?t=1755711010\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/013f4911b82b2bcea83875a83c9f7619.webm?t=1755711010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810130/extras/013f4911b82b2bcea83875a83c9f7619.mp4?t=1755711010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No Combat, No Safety. You can only endure.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
